  "transcription": "Add. Ms a 94 18 (91)\n(91)\n1. $n=2.$ $(1-k')(1-l) = 2k'l.$\n$n=4$ $(1-\\sqrt{k'})(1-\\sqrt{l}) = 2\\sqrt{(k'l)}.$\n$n=8$ $(1-\\sqrt{k'})(1-\\sqrt{l}) = 2(4k'l)^{\\frac14}.$\n2. $n=2$ $\\frac12 M^2 = \\frac{1+l}{1+k'} = \\frac{1+l^2}{1+k'^2}.$\n$n=4$ $\\frac12 M = \\frac{1+\\sqrt{l}}{1+\\sqrt{k'}} = \\frac{1+l}{1+k'}.$\n$n=16$ $\\frac12\\sqrt{M} = \\frac{1+\\sqrt{l}}{1+\\sqrt{k'}}.$\n3. $n=2$ $\\begin{cases} Mk'+l=1. & M^2k'+l^2=1. \\\\ \\frac{2}{M}l+k'=1. & \\frac{4}{M^2}l+k'^2=1. \\end{cases}$\n$n=4$ $\\begin{cases} \\sqrt{M}\\sqrt{k'}+\\sqrt{l}=1. & M\\sqrt{k'}+l=1. \\\\ \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{M}}\\sqrt{l}+\\sqrt{k'}=1. & \\frac{4}{M}\\sqrt{l}+k'=1 \\end{cases}$\n$n=8$ $\\begin{cases} \\sqrt{M}(k')^{\\frac14}+\\sqrt{l}=1. \\\\ 2\\sqrt{(\\frac{2}{M})}\\, l^{\\frac14}+\\sqrt{k'}=1. \\end{cases}$\n4. $n=3.$ $\\sqrt{(kl)}+\\sqrt{(k'l')}=1$\n$n=7.$ $(kl)^{\\frac14}+(k'l')^{\\frac14}=1$ } known.\n$n=15.$ $(kl)^{\\frac18}\\left[\\{(1+k)(1+l)\\}^{\\frac14}+\\{(1-k)(1-l)\\}^{\\frac14}\\right]$\n$+(k'l')^{\\frac18}\\left[\\{(1+k')(1+l')\\}^{\\frac14}+\\{(1-k')(1-l')\\}^{\\frac14}\\right] = \\sqrt{2}.$\n$n=31.$ $(kl)^{\\frac1{16}}\\left[\\{(1+k)(1+l)\\}^{\\frac18}\\sqrt{\\{1+\\sqrt{(kl)}+\\sqrt{\\{(1-k)(1-l)\\}}\\}}\\right.$\n$\\left.+\\{(1-k)(1-l)\\}^{\\frac18}\\sqrt{\\{1+\\sqrt{(kl)}+\\sqrt{\\{(1+k)(1+l)\\}}\\}}\\right]$\n$+(k'l')^{\\frac1{16}}\\left[\\{(1+k')(1+l')\\}^{\\frac18}\\sqrt{\\{1+\\sqrt{(k'l')}+\\sqrt{\\{(1-k')(1-l')\\}}\\}}\\right.$\n$\\left.+\\{(1-k')(1-l')\\}^{\\frac18}\\sqrt{\\{1+\\sqrt{(k'l')}+\\sqrt{\\{(1+k')(1+l')\\}}\\}}\\right]$\n$= 2^{\\frac34}.$",
